    "summary": "ImageMagick has a Heap Buffer Over-Write in SF3 encoder when writing multi-frame image",
    "details": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to version 7.1.2-25, a crafted multi-frame can result in a heap buffer over-write when encoding it with the SF3 encoder. This issue has been patched in version 7.1.2-25.",
